Subject: [PATCH] logging: structure RPC authentication and lifecycle
 diagnostics

Preserve levels, categories and message wording. Add custom typed rpc_user without an unrelated ECS/OTel role; retain raw method names as OriginalMethod. The RPC whitelist test checks the actual denial event, username and raw method as fields.

